{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/8f7c7a5b526de5396d8923587fa241b1.avif?t=1724172090\" width=770 height=574 /></span><br>In Sich Tactics you control the party of Cossacks of different classes and fight with enemies on procedurally generated arenas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" width=224 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep turn-based tactics</h2>It is a small game with quick game sessions and deep tactics. One of the key features is the use of verticality to your advantage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" width=224 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cossacks of different classes</h2>Each class has unique abilities and plays its role on the battlefield. But the real strength lies in their smart interaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\